<title>USA: Bollinger Industries Q2 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Bollinger Industries Q2 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr   loss		 $0.07   profit	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net   loss		   267   profit	   461</p>
<p> Sales		     19,092		   21,489</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,000		    3,950</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.26     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net	loss	    1,032     loss	   534</p>
<p> Sales		     41,526		   34,250</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,000		    3,972</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The company's current year results included a gain of $807,000 on the disposal of the company's discontinued health care business. Q3 1996 loss from continuing operations was $0.27 per share, compared to a profit of $0.16 per share in 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name is Bollinger Industries Inc.</p>
</text>
